column235:
31/Mar/26 12:46 PM;ndavis2;LVDT testing with Arley and I wrapped up. We made significant progress on 03/30 and finished the last two remaining datasets 03/31.

Initially ran into what we thought was an error with the O-scope when writing 7FFF to the SIM card. Data and DVM measurements looked good but the O-scope had fluctuating data. Turns out it was a non-issue, 7FFF is the max threshold of data for these card registers so O-scope data so that may have caused the initial fluctuation in the data.

Ultimately results were good and we are preparing to move on to Resolver tests.;;;

